    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "Introduction",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh. You just moved in, right? Cool.#$e#Out of all the places you could live, you chose Pelican Town?",
      "translation": "Aha. Tak ty jsi ta nová tvář, že? Fajn.#$e#Ze všech míst k životu padla tvá volba zrovna na Pelikánov?",
