    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "dating_Sebastian",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't make fun of me... but I've never been in a relationship like this before.$l^Don't make fun of me... but I've never really had a girlfriend before.$l",
      "translation": "Nesměj se mi... ale ještě nikdy jsem s nikým takhle nechodil.$l^Nesměj se mi... ale ještě nikdy jsem vlastně neměl přítelkyni.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "464613a5d071b401b16326f2e214c6f8d053727bdf79b8747cc43e11f858609c",
      "translationSHA256": "03d801f0abacab8f4f9a5202a67c83a6d10d959475e7b5ac7be3d17cd897dc5f",
