    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "AcceptGift_(O)575",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Is that obsidian? This is exactly what I've been looking for... I'm gonna see if I can shape it into a dagger.$h",
      "translation": "Je to obsidián? Přesně tohle jsem hledal... Zkusím z něj vytvarovat dýku.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "edd0df106fa90cd98600702be7be918d078b7848e83632cb243ba667ba8eb154",
      "translationSHA256": "23abe18e55645ad031c4e211b3a5aa5632158d10c5b582d701504f88053032a3",
      "reviewChecks": [
