      "key": "AcceptGift_(TR)FrogEgg",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, that's a frog egg! I'll see if I can get it to hatch. Thanks!$h",
      "translation": "Hej, to je žabí vejce! Zkusím ho nechat vylíhnout. Díky!$h",
