      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "firstVisit_Railroad",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm glad the path to the railroad tracks is open again.#$b#I like going up there when I feel like being alone.#$e#...Which is often.",
      "translation": "Jsem rád, že je cesta k železniční trati znovu otevřená.#$b#Rád tam chodím, když chci být sám.#$e#... Což je často.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c784d9706389e1b7ab441413efb59464abc3dd902c74671e3b83c8cf499e6643",
      "translationSHA256": "819a82612ed228aa7237c463b5268eb2635d9be1c5e0b03a62e2d485cc91bb5d",
