      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "Resort_Entering",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I liked the boat ride. At one point you couldn't see any land at all..",
      "translation": "Cesta lodí se mi líbila. V jednu chvíli nebyla vidět vůbec žádná pevnina.",
